Here's your problem ! This bit me when I upgraded from 5.5-2 to 6.2 and neither DEC
nor I could find it for 2 agonizing days of user's screaming for
printers.

The PASTHRU option disables all flow control. Change the option to
/INTERACTIVE.

    $ SET TERM /PERMANANT /INTERACTIVE LTAxxx:

Good luck!

Joe Ambrose


